Coordinator: web shell + admin UI are done. Please match these shapes (adapter in web/src/features/admin/api.ts tolerates bare arrays/{items}/snake_case, but aim for these exactly):
- GET /api/admin/overview → {activeUsers, runsToday, tokensToday, costToday, errorRate (0..1), activeRuns, reqPerMin, usersTotal}
- GET /api/admin/timeseries?metric&range&groupBy → {points:[{ts,value}]} or, when groupBy given, {series:[{key,label,points:[{ts,value}]}]}
- Users: GET/POST /admin/users; PATCH /admin/users/:id {name,email,role,disabled,limits:{dailyTokens,models,modes},password} (password reset via PATCH); DELETE; GET/PUT /admin/users/:id/projects {grants:[{projectId,role}]}
- GET /admin/projects → projects with members:[{userId,email,name,role}] + optional runs/tokens. Members edit: GET/PUT /projects/:id/members {members:[{userId,role}]}; archive via PATCH /projects/:id {archived}
- GET /admin/prompts?userId&projectId&q&cursor&limit → {items:[{id,createdAt,userId,userEmail,projectId,projectName,projectSlug,content,attachments[],ip,run:{status,model,mode,inputTokens,outputTokens,cacheRead,cacheWrite,costUsd,durationMs},response}],nextCursor}
- GET /admin/runs/active → [{id,status,userEmail,projectName,projectSlug,model,mode,startedAt,inputTokens,outputTokens,ip}]; POST /admin/runs/:id/abort
- GET /admin/traffic?range → {topIps:[{ip,count,userEmail?,lastSeen?}], byStatus:[{status,count}], topPaths:[{path,count,avgMs}], perMinute:[{ts,count}], recent:[{ts,ip,userEmail,method,path,status,ms}]}
- GET /admin/ip-rules → {rules:[{id,cidr,kind:'allow'|'block',note,createdAt}], clientIp}; POST {cidr,kind,note}; DELETE /admin/ip-rules/:id
- GET /admin/activity?action&cursor&limit → {items:[{id,ts,userEmail,ip,action,target,meta}],nextCursor}; failed logins use action=login_failed
- GET /admin/settings → {models, defaultModel, globalDailyTokenCap, claudeAuth:{set,masked,kind,updatedAt}}; PUT partial; claudeAuthToken write-only, "" clears.
- POST /auth/password {currentPassword,newPassword}; POST /projects {name,description,color,icon,slug?}.
- Token meters/limits count input + output + cacheWrite (exclude cacheRead) — enforce daily limits the same way.
When finished, also run the full `docker compose build app` (Dockerfile.app) to make sure the whole web+server image builds.

